This package is a personal derivative of pi-sakura-cyberdeck by beautifulrem.
Original project: https://github.com/beautifulrem/pi-sakura-cyberdeck
License: MIT.

The upstream project integrates the components credited below; those
attributions are carried over and remain in effect.

This package includes a modified copy of the Footer portion of pi-zentui by Luka.
Original project: https://github.com/lmilojevicc/pi-zentui
License: MIT. Full license text: licenses/pi-zentui-MIT.txt

Modifications include the Sakura Macaron palette, package-specific Footer defaults,
dynamic project/runtime/Git data, and a package-specific configuration path.
The package also includes its own cyberdeck Header and Sakura Macaron theme.

Session, model, activity, MCP, configuration-count, and Codex subscription
status capabilities are adapted from pi-shannon-statusline by RealAlexandreAI:
https://github.com/RealAlexandreAI/pi-shannon-statusline
License: MIT. Full license text: licenses/pi-shannon-statusline-MIT.txt
The integrated presentation has been rewritten for the Sakura Zentui Footer;
Shannon's HUD, Matrix animation, independent Footer, and Monokai palette are not included.

The Codex usage client included under extensions/zentui/codex-usage derives from
pi-codex-usage by narumiruna and is MIT licensed. Its full license text is kept
at extensions/zentui/codex-usage/LICENSE.
